ata-orig="Improved/Drought-Resistant Varieties">Improved/Drought-Resistant Varieties</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="Developed through local breeding programs to enhance yield in arid and semi-arid climates">Developed through local breeding programs to enhance yield in arid and semi-arid climates</span>.</li></ul></li><li data-start="2739" data-end="2963"><p data-start="2741" data-end="2772"><strong data-start="2741" data-end="2772"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="Growing Conditions">Growing Conditions</span> &amp; Урожай:</strong></p><ul data-start="2775" data-end="2963"><li data-start="2775" data-end="2852"><strong data-start="2777" data-end="2789"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="Climate">Climate</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="Prefers warm">Prefers warm</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="dry environments and is highly drought-tolerant">dry environments and is highly drought-tolerant</span>.</li><li data-start="2855" data-end="2963"><strong data-start="2857" data-end="2867">Урожай:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="Typically around 0.8–1.5 tons per hectare">Typically around 0.8–1.5 tons per hectare</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="depending on local conditions and farming practices">depending on local conditions and farming practices</span>.</li></ul></li><li data-start="2965" data-end="3276"><p data-start="2967" data-end="2994"><strong data-start="2967" data-end="2994">Использование &amp; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="Cooking Methods">Cooking Methods</span>:</strong></p><ul data-start="2997" data-end="3276"><li data-start="2997" data-end="3061"><strong data-start="2999" data-end="3018"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="Direct Cooking">Direct Cooking</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" dat