inoa well">Rinse quinoa well</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_146" data-source="" data-orig="boil for">boil for</span> 15 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_147" data-source="" data-orig="minutes">minutes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_148" data-source="" data-orig="and top with a drizzle of honey">and top with a drizzle of honey</span>.</li></ul></li><li data-start="6230" data-end="6449"><p data-start="6232" data-end="6250"><strong data-start="6232" data-end="6250"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_149" data-source="" data-orig="Salad Upgrade">Salad Upgrade</span>:</strong></p><ul data-start="6253" data-end="6449"><li data-start="6253" data-end="6371"><strong data-start="6255" data-end="6268">Сценарий:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_150" data-source="" data-orig="For a refreshing lunch">For a refreshing lunch</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_151" data-source="" data-orig="toss cooked quinoa with chopped vegetables">toss cooked quinoa with chopped vegetables</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_152" data-source="" data-orig="olive oil">olive oil</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_153" data-source="" data-orig="lemon juice">lemon juice</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_154" data-source="" data-orig="and herbs">and herbs</span>.</li><li data-start="6374" data-end="6449"><strong data-start="6376" data-end="6384"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_155" data-source="" data-orig="Tip">Tip</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_156" data-source="" data-orig="Its nutty flavor enhances the taste of fresh greens and avocado">Its nutty flavor enhances the taste of fresh greens and avocado</span>.</li></ul></li><li data-start="6451" data-end="6664"><p data-start="6453" data-end="6482"><strong data-start="6453" data-end="6482"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_157" data-source="" data-orig="Side Dish or Main Course">Side Dish or Main Course</span>:</strong></p><ul data-start="6485" data-end="6664"><li data-start="6485" data-end="6586"><strong data-start="6487" data-end="6500">Сценарий:</strong> <span cl