tr_" id="tr_177" data-source="" data-orig="Pair with legumes and vegetables to create a balanced">Pair with legumes and vegetables to create a balanced</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_178" data-source="" data-orig="low-GI meal">low-GI meal</span>.</li></ul></li></ul><hr data-start="7366" data-end="7369" /><h2 data-start="7371" data-end="7421"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="6_Health_Recommendations_Scientific_Evidence"></span>6. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_179" data-source="" data-orig="Health Recommendations">Health Recommendations</span> &amp; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_180" data-source="" data-orig="Scientific Evidence">Scientific Evidence</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="7423" data-end="7552"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_181" data-source="" data-orig="Incorporating both grains into your diet can offer a wide range of health benefits">Incorporating both grains into your diet can offer a wide range of health benefits</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_182" data-source="" data-orig="Here are some science-backed recommendations">Here are some science-backed recommendations</span>:</p><ul data-start="7554" data-end="8790"><li data-start="7554" data-end="7874"><p data-start="7556" data-end="7580"><strong data-start="7556" data-end="7580"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_183" data-source="" data-orig="Blood Sugar Control">Blood Sugar Control</span>:</strong></p><ul data-start="7583" data-end="7874"><li data-start="7583" data-end="7738"><strong data-start="7585" data-end="7598"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_184" data-source="" data-orig="Evidence">Evidence</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_185" data-source="" data-orig="Studies published in the">Studies published in the</span> <em data-start="7624" data-end="7664"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_186" data-source="" data-orig="American Journal of Clinical Nutrition">American Journal of Clinical Nutrition</span></em> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_187" data-source="" data-orig="indicate that low glycemic index foods help stabilize blood sugar levels">indicate that low glycemic index foods help stabilize blood sugar levels</span>.</li><li data-start="7741" data-end="7874"><strong data-start="7743" data-end="7754"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_188" data-source="" data-orig="Advice">Advice</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_189" data-source="" data-orig="If you’re diabetic or pre-diabetic">If you’re diabetic or pre-diabetic</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_190" data-source="" data-orig="consider incorporating korralu">consider incorporating korralu</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_191" data-source="" data-orig="which is associated with a lower glycemic response">which is associated with a lower glycemic response</span>.</li></ul></li><li data-start="7876" data-end="8185"><p data-start="7878" data-end="7895"><strong data-start="7878" data-end="7895"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_192" data-source="" data-orig="Heart Health">Heart Health</span>:</strong></p><ul data-start="7898" data-end="8185"><li data-start="7898" data-end="8058"><strong data-start="7900" data-end="7913"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_193" data-source="" data-orig="Evidence">Evidence</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_194" data-source="" data-orig="Research in journals like">Research in journals like</span> <em data-start="7940" data-end="7960"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_195" data-source="" data-orig="Nutrition Research">Nutrition Research</span></em> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_196" data-source="" data-orig="suggests that the unsaturated fats and antioxidants in quinoa can help reduce cholesterol levels">suggests that the unsaturated fats and antioxidants in quinoa can help reduce cholesterol levels</span>.</li><li data-start="8061" data-end="8185"><strong data-start="8063" data-end="8074"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_197" data-source="" data-orig="Advice">Advice</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_198" data-source="" data-orig="Use quinoa in moderation if you’re watching your fat intake">Use quinoa in moderation if you’re watching your fat intake</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_199" data-source="" data-orig="pair it with vegetables for a heart-healthy meal">pair it with vegetables for a heart-healthy meal</span>.</li></ul></li><li data-start="8187" data-end="8473"><p data-start="8189" data-end="8210"><strong data-start="8189" data-end="8210"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_200" data-source="" data-orig="Digestive Health">Digestive Health</span>:</strong></p><ul data-start="8213" data-end="8473"><li data-start="8213" data-end="8372"><strong data-start="8215" data-end="8228"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_201" data-source="" data-orig="Evidence">Evidence</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_202" data-source="" data-orig="High dietary fiber">High dietary fiber</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_203" data-source="" data-orig="as found in both quinoa and korralu">as found in both quinoa and korralu</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_204" data-source="" data-orig="aids digestion and supports a healthy gut microbiome">aids digestion and supports a healthy gut microbiome</span> (источник: <em data-start="8348" data-end="8370"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_205" data-source="" data-orig="Journal of Nutrition">Journal of Nutrition</span></em>).</li><li data-start="8375" data-end="8473"><strong data-start="8377" data-end="8388"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_206" data-source="" data-orig="Advice">Advice</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_207" data-source="" data-orig="Combine these grains with fermented foods like yogurt or kimchi to boost gut health">Combine these grains with fermented foods like yogurt or kimchi to boost gut health</span>.</li></ul></li><li data-start="8475" data-end="8790"><p data-start="8477" data-end="8505"><strong data-start="8477" data-end="8505"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_208" data-source="" data-orig="Overall Dietary Balance">Overall Dietary Balance</span>:</strong></p><ul data-start="8508" data-end="8790"><li data-start="8508" data-end="8642"><strong data-start="8510" data-end="8521"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_209" data-source="" data-orig="Advice">Advice</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_210" data-source="" data-orig="A varied diet that includes both quinoa and korralu can help you achieve a balance of macronutrients and micronutrients">A varied diet that includes both quinoa and korralu can help you achieve a balance of macronutrients and micronutrients</span>.</li><li data-start="8645" data-end="8790"><strong data-start="8647" data-end="8670"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_211" data-source="" data-orig="Serving Suggestion">Serving Suggestion</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_212" data-source="" data-orig="Aim for 30–50 grams per serving of these grains as part of a meal">Aim for 30–50 grams per serving of these grains as part of a meal</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_213" data-source="" data-orig="and mix with vegetables">and mix with vegetables</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_214" data-source="" data-orig="legumes">legumes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_215" data-source="" data-orig="and lean proteins">and lean proteins</span>.</li></ul></li></ul><hr /><p data-start="9513" data-end="9766"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_216" data-source="" data-orig="Remember">Remember</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_217" data-source="" data-orig="balancing ancient grains in your diet is supported by numerous studies">balancing ancient grains in your diet is supported by numerous studies</span> (НАПРИМЕР., <span class ="tr_" id="tr_218" data-source="" data-orig="those published in the">those published in the</span> <em data-start="9624" data-end="9664"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_219" data-source="" data-orig="American Journal of Clinical Nutrition">American Journal of Clinical Nutrition</span></em> и <em data-start="9669" data-end="9691"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_220" data-source="" data-orig="Journal of Nutrition">Journal of Nutrition</span></em>).</p>`} />
